    "slides": [
      {
        "id": "7de746fe-6214-44ef-bb5c-3db8c0d98b0e",
        "layout": "title",
        "background": {
          "type": "color",
          "value": "#fefce8",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        "notes": "Welcome everyone. Today we are exploring Natural Language Processing, the core discipline that allows machines to understand, interpret, and generate human language. Let's look at how this technology is transforming enterprises.",
        "elements": [
          {
            "id": "99f214fe-86e1-4c27-b013-67956100cac2",
            "type": "heading",
            "x": 160,
            "y": 280,
            "width": 1600,
            "height": 180,
            "content": "The Architecture of Human-AI Communication",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
              "fontSize": 64,
              "fontWeight": 800,
              "color": "#7c2d12",
              "textAlign": "center"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "5abf603f-5f77-462c-9dec-35b799f163ea",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 200,
            "y": 490,
            "width": 1520,
            "height": 100,
            "content": "Bridging the gap between unstructured text and actionable machine intelligence",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "color": "#78716c",
              "textAlign": "center"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "fd873c5a-a0a6-436f-9734-cb0e68d8a853",
        "layout": "title-content",
        "background": {
          "type": "color",
          "value": "#fefce8",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        "notes": "To understand NLP, we must look past simple keyword searches. Modern NLP relies on tokens, embeddings, and attention mechanisms to truly grasp the nuances and intent behind human communication.",
        "elements": [
          {
            "id": "c819e419-467e-4244-91b1-cd2aa681f880",
            "type": "heading",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 90,
            "width": 1680,
            "height": 90,
            "content": "Core Foundations of Modern NLP",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
              "fontSize": 48,
              "fontWeight": 700,
              "color": "#292524",
              "textAlign": "left"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "9c37d89f-b000-46e7-bf38-947f0f6c3301",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 220,
            "width": 1680,
            "height": 720,
            "content": "Moving from keyword matching to deep contextual comprehension\n\n• Tokenization breaks continuous text into manageable linguistic units for computational analysis\n\n• Semantic embeddings map words and phrases into high-dimensional vector spaces to capture true meaning\n\n• Attention mechanisms allow models to weigh the contextual importance of different words in a sentence",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "color": "#292524",
              "lineHeight": 1.9
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d6a2e315-6eff-454a-bb98-b49bb370ec64",
        "layout": "two-column",
        "background": {
          "type": "color",
          "value": "#fefce8",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        "notes": "Historically, NLP relied on rigid statistical models and hand-crafted rules. Today, transformer architectures dominate by processing entire texts in parallel and learning subtle contextual cues dynamically.",
        "elements": [
          {
            "id": "56b1b1ff-f51e-4e2f-b37f-028f5a3a3362",
            "type": "heading",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 90,
            "width": 1680,
            "height": 90,
            "content": "Evolution of Language Architectures",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
              "fontSize": 48,
              "fontWeight": 700,
              "color": "#292524",
              "textAlign": "left"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "44b9660e-a453-41c3-9055-ecbe0dec955a",
            "type": "shape",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 220,
            "width": 800,
            "height": 720,
            "content": "rounded",
            "style": {
              "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7",
              "borderColor": "#2a1f56",
              "borderWidth": 1,
              "borderRadius": 20
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "1937673b-3586-4d0e-85e5-16ddf5289edc",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 160,
            "y": 260,
            "width": 720,
            "height": 640,
            "content": "• Traditional Statistical Models (N-grams, TF-IDF)\n\n• Rule-based syntactic parsing and grammar trees\n\n• Limited context retention and high maintenance overhead\n\n• Prone to failure with ambiguous or colloquial phrasing",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 26,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "color": "#292524",
              "lineHeight": 1.8
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "d12f16c5-e4b4-455b-9bcb-d68cf17ddab1",
            "type": "shape",
            "x": 1000,
            "y": 220,
            "width": 800,
            "height": 720,
            "content": "rounded",
            "style": {
              "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7",
              "borderColor": "#2a1f56",
              "borderWidth": 1,
              "borderRadius": 20
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "659ceee3-2605-4edc-8251-04b58b0cabf1",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 1040,
            "y": 260,
            "width": 720,
            "height": 640,
            "content": "• Transformer-Based Deep Learning Models\n\n• Self-attention processing for entire documents simultaneously\n\n• Deep contextual understanding across multiple languages\n\n• Few-shot adaptability for specialized enterprise domains",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 26,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "color": "#292524",
              "lineHeight": 1.8
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "5ec265c0-5e3f-4fef-b51f-7b96599c0d20",
