        "background": {
          "type": "color",
          "value": "#fefce8",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        "notes": "Most enterprise data is locked in unstructured formats like emails, PDFs, and chat logs. NLP acts as the key to unlock this data, turning isolated text into structured, searchable intelligence.",
        "elements": [
          {
            "id": "6b26e6d0-23a0-403f-bb76-88084531e1b4",
            "type": "heading",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 90,
            "width": 1680,
            "height": 80,
            "content": "Unlocking Unstructured Enterprise Data",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
              "fontSize": 44,
              "fontWeight": 700,
              "color": "#292524",
              "textAlign": "left"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "9dd5507a-56f3-4cd3-9dfd-a54563f9155a",
            "type": "image",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 210,
            "width": 820,
            "height": 740,
            "content": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526374965328-7f61d4dc18c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
            "style": {
              "borderRadius": 16,
              "objectFit": "cover"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "7a50901c-0e31-4186-9356-061aaac25bbd",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 1000,
            "y": 230,
            "width": 800,
            "height": 700,
            "content": "Turning millions of isolated documents into a unified knowledge graph\n\n• Extracting critical entities, compliance risks, and action items from contracts\n\n• Synthesizing customer feedback across global support channels in real time\n\n• Automating knowledge retrieval to empower internal teams instantly",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "color": "#292524",
              "lineHeight": 1.8
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "1b140284-8605-41b0-a930-d899350d308b",
        "layout": "two-column",
        "background": {
          "type": "color",
          "value": "#fefce8",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        "notes": "As we deploy these systems, we must address critical challenges. Technical hurdles like latency and hallucinations must be balanced against strict governance, data privacy, and bias mitigation.",
        "elements": [
          {
            "id": "0855bf62-ac78-4c6b-b25e-af906a75b8ba",
            "type": "heading",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 90,
