        "background": {
          "type": "color",
          "value": "#fefce8",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        "notes": "In conclusion, successful NLP adoption requires a clear strategy: start by auditing your data silos, ensure strict governance, and build hybrid models that deliver verifiable business outcomes. Thank you.",
        "elements": [
          {
            "id": "d456742f-6db2-4238-be16-57bb7107f542",
            "type": "heading",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 90,
            "width": 1680,
            "height": 90,
            "content": "Strategic Roadmap for NLP Adoption",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
