            "x": 120,
            "y": 220,
            "width": 1680,
            "height": 720,
            "content": "Key takeaways for executive leaders and technical stakeholders\n\n• Audit existing unstructured data silos to identify high-ROI use cases\n\n• Establish robust data governance and security frameworks before scaling\n\n• Invest in hybrid architectures that combine retrieval with generative models",
            "style": {
