            "type": "text",
            "x": 160,
            "y": 260,
            "width": 720,
            "height": 640,
            "content": "• Rule-based systems and statistical NLP\n\n• Heavy reliance on manual feature engineering\n\n• Limited context retention across long passages\n\n• Fragile when encountering domain-specific slang",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 26,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "color": "#f8fafc",
              "lineHeight": 1.8
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "c818f5b6-a15e-4d48-8add-a367137a94ca",
            "type": "shape",
            "x": 1000,
            "y": 220,
            "width": 800,
            "height": 720,
            "content": "rounded",
            "style": {
              "backgroundColor": "#17122e",
